    "collapsible_content_c8cmWE": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_ctqkgL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "White Label",
            "icon": "price_tag",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Zero Cost</strong></p><p>You are free to purchase our products as-is and relabel them yourself. You are free to sell the products as you like under your own brand.</p><p>This includes:</p><ul><li>Ordering products, removing our label & replacing it with your own label.</li><li>Ordering bulk product and repacking it into your own containers for retail or refill applications.</li><li>You are also free to order unscented product and add your own signature scent to it.</li><li>See more information in the \"relabeling guidelines\" section.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_7jAzQU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Blank Product ( No Label )",
            "icon": "price_tag",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>10% fee</strong></p><p>Unlabeled, ready-to-sell inventory that you can apply your label to.</p><ul><li>Product is produced without a label affixed for a 10% fee. ($100 order would cost $110)</li><li>The fee for production of blank labeled items is waived for order quantities over 500 items or for repeat orders totaling over 1,000 items over the span of 3 months ( min. 250 units per order )</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ygUiRR": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Custom-Labeled Products",
            "icon": "price_tag",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>$100 Set up fee + 20%</strong></p><p>Ready-to-sell items shipped with your brand's label affixed.</p><ul><li>The initial $100 set up fee is to test the provided label and make sure it works within our printing process. If more development is needed, additional charges may apply. <em>This fee is waived if pre-printed labels are provided.</em></li><li>20% fee applies to each order where Custom-Labeled Products are ordered.</li><li>The fee for production of Custom Labeled items is waived for order quantities over 500 items or for repeat orders totaling over 1,000 items over the span of 3 months ( min. 250 units per order ).</li><li>Assessment is Free: We want to be able to help you get into business easily! You're more than welcome to send us an email if you have questions about an idea you have. </li></ul><p><em>At this time, our team will not be able to help you design or execute your vision in a manner that is cost-effective. Instead, we recommend seeking out a design agency that specializes in producing multi-faceted work.</em></p><p></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_D4gaPm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Custom Labels or Label Design",
            "icon": "price_tag",
            "row_content": "<p>At this time, we are focusing exclusively on our existing product formulations and standard labeling options. Clients seeking custom fragrances, formulations, ingredient modifications, or custom labeling will need to pursue those services independently.</p><p>Our branding team's sole focus is to produce work that fits our brand's vision. All creative output is done in our specialized style, with no deviation. We will not be able to help you execute your unique vision in a manner that is cost effective. Instead, we recommend seeking out a design agency that specializes in producing multi-faceted work.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
