    "collapsible_content_wUre8J": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_DP9xGK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Combine 2 Available Scents",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Included with all of our <a href=\"/collections/custom-scent\" title=\"Custom Scent\">Custom Scent </a>product options.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_yGbjtx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Adding Your Custom Scent",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Add scents yourself:</strong></p><p><strong>$0 additional cost - </strong>Purchase our Unscented formula and add your own fragrance. </p><p>Each Fragrance or Essential Oil will react differently with our formulas. Some may thin, and some may thicken. It is recommended to start with small tests of about 4 oz to ensure that you get the scent strength and consistency you are looking for.</p><p><strong>Let Rustic Strength produce your scented product:</strong></p><p><strong>$250+</strong></p><p>Send us your fragrance. We will put the scent into products of your choice and send you a sample to test.</p><ul><li>Putting a fragrance in a product does not guarantee it will work. Additional development may be required ( see below options )</li><li>Ordering is simple, you will be able to check out from our wholesale website and purchase your custom item. Please note this process can take up to 30 days.</li><li><em>Making additional changes after samples are received ( such as changing the scent load ) incurs an additional $250 per 3 items, per change.</em></li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_FmhedJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Create a Custom Scent",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>$500 +</strong></p><p>Send us your favorite scent and we will replicate it! These fees are inclusive of sending a sample in the product that you choose.</p><ul><li><em>While we can guarantee a close replication of the scent itself, we cannot change the laws of chemistry:</em></li><li><em>Not all fragrances are guaranteed to work within all products.</em></li><li><em>Not all fragrances in a product smell exactly the same as they do in a bottle.</em></li><li><em>Not all fragrances may smell strongly in a product.</em></li><li><em>We do not know in advance whether or not the fragrance you chose will have or not have any of these problems.</em></li><li><em>Additional modifications to the scent will be billed at the hourly rate of $400, in some cases a flat $500 fee may be offered.</em></li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6h69n8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Custom Blends & Fragrance Formulation",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>You may use our Unscented product bases to create your own scents. </p><p>At this time, we are focusing exclusively on our existing product formulations and standard labeling options. Clients seeking custom fragrances, formulations, ingredient modifications, or custom labeling will need to pursue those services independently.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_hrjyLN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Development or Ingredient Change",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>At this time, we are focusing exclusively on our existing product formulations and standard labeling options. Clients seeking custom fragrances, formulations, ingredient modifications, or custom labeling will need to pursue those services independently.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
